ara East, Nala Sopara, Maharashtra 401209\n\n[![Google](https://www.google.com/favicon.ico) Add As A Preferred  \nSource On Google](https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=Addressofchoice.com)\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\nPrice Range Starting from\n\n###### 64.11 Lakhs to 97.01 Lakhs\\*\n\n![Agarwal Residency](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/41011/Agarwal_Residency_elevation_1.jpg \"Agarwal Residency\")\n\n# Agarwal Residency in Vasai, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price | Floor Plan | Photos | Master Plan | Brochure | Amenities | Location\n\n![Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-floor-plan.jpg \"Floor Plan\")\n\n![Site Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-site-plan.jpg \"Site Plan\")\n\n![Agarwal Residency](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/41011/Agarwal_Residency_elevation_1.jpg \"Agarwal Residency\")\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\n#### Are you interested in property?\n\nGet attractive benefits with addressofchoice.com\n\n* [Highlights](#review)\n* [Overview](#overview)\n* [Units](#price_listWarpper)\n* [Specifications](#specifications)\n* [Locality & Price Trends](#locality)\n* [Related Projects](#Projects)\n* [Developers](#Developers)\n* [Review & Ratings](#rating)\n* [FAQs](#faqs)\n\n1 ,2 BHK Residential Property \n\nEMI Start at ₹\n\nStatus: **Ready to Move**\n\n[![call](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/call-outline.svg) CONTACT NOW](javascript:void(0)) [![home](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/conversation.svg) FAQ's](#faq_Property)\n\n* Apartment Sizes Ranges in Between 575 sqft - 870 sqft.\n* Total Units & Towers: 189 Units & 1 Towers\n* Total Project Area: 0 Acres\n* Possession: August, 2013\n* Rera:\n\n## About\n\n3.0\n\n##### Excellent\n\n1 reviews\n\nCrafted by the renowned Agarwal Group, **Agarwal Residency** is in the developing area of Vasai, Mumbai City. This ready to move project has units of 1 and 2 BHK flats with the size of 575 sq.ft. to 870 sq.ft. for the buyers.  Each flat is built keeping Vaastu requirements of owners in mind. The region is connected to other parts of the city through roadways and railways. The region has fine and famous schools, reputed hospitals, banks and ATM branches around. The homes here meet all the necessary requirements and also offer features that make the property more preferable over other property in other projects.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg) Kids Play Area\n* ![Swimming Pool](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-pool.svg) Swimming Pool\n\n### Convenience Amenities\n\n* ![Lifts](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804644_lift.svg) Lifts\n* ![Car Parking](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804679_parking.svg) Car Parking\n* ![Water Storage](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886749_water_storage.svg) Water Storage\n* ![Waste Disposal](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528886685_waste_disposal.svg) Waste Disposal\n* ![Maintenance Staff](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804773_maintenance-staff.svg) Maintenance Staff\n* ![Wi-fi connectivity](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804529_wifi.svg) Wi-fi connectivity\n* ![Multipurpose Hall](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804708_multipurpose-hall.svg) Multipurpose Hall\n* ![Restaurants](https://www.addressofchoic